{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41840","headline":"秋雨 · 李中","name":"秋雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竟日散如丝，吟看半掩扉。\n秋声在梧叶，润气逼书帏。\n曲涧泉承去，危檐燕带归。\n寒蛩悲旅壁，乱藓滑渔矶。\n爽欲除幽簟，凉须换熟衣。\n疎篷谁梦断，荒径独游稀。\n偏称江湖景，不妨鸥鹭飞。\n最怜爲瑞处，南亩稻苗肥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41840.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41840","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}